-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LZMA SDK (7-Zip) - public domain
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files under slimpack/native/lzma/ (LzmaDec.c, LzmaDec.h, 7zTypes.h,
Compiler.h, Precomp.h, CpuArch.h, 7zWindows.h) are taken from the LZMA SDK by
Igor Pavlov, obtained from the official 7-Zip source repository
(https://github.com/ip7z/7zip).

The LZMA SDK is placed in the public domain. slimpack uses only its
decompressor (LzmaDec) in the one-file launcher stub to decompress the
appended payload at startup.
